<title>JAPAN: Nankai Railway files shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Nankai Railway files shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nankai Electric Railway Co Ltd said on Monday that it had filed an application to the Finance Ministry for a shelf registration to issue up to 50 billion yen worth of corporate bonds.</p>
<p>The registration will be effective from November 15, it said.</p>
</text>
